WEBVTT

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.570
Where... am I?

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:14.990
Hmm?

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.840
A pig in a straw house... It's as if...

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.140
You're mine, juicy little piggy!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.090
That was close.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.550
Shido?

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.430
Shido, I'm so glad to see you.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.300
Yoshino? What's that outfit?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.640
I don't know. I was in it when I got here.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:51.440
I was told to bring this to Grandma's.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.230
It's bizarre.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:58.940
Spirit power and Angels don't work here,
so we just went with the flow.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:05.080
Well, I'm one of the
Three Little Pigs, so I'm thinking...

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:10.160
Wait. If this is Grandma's house
in <i>Little Red Riding Hood</i>...

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.130
What a good little girl.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:23.010
Not only did you come, but you brought
a tasty piggy with you, too!

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.260
Grandma's gone beast mode!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.890
I'm gonna gobble both of you up!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.070
You okay, Shido?! Yoshino?!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.200
Tohka... Nia...

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:49.410
Tohka! Give 'em one of those
millet dumplings on your belt!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.580
These?

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:05.890
Gee, I'm so sorry!
I get like that when I'm hangry.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.180
Uh, right...

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:12.230
That's Momotaro's
millet dumplings for you!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.400
Who knew dumplings did that?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:21.190
Nia, what in the world is this?
Were we swallowed by Beelzebub?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:26.200
More like we're in a world
that was created by Beelzebub.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.370
Which story are you?

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.330
Oh, me? I'm Fatima from <i>Silver Bullet</i>.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.580
That's your own fricken manga.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.250
How do we get back to our world?

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:41.510
Well, Westcott's not gonna let us out.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:48.100
Which means we've gotta find someone
with the power to break us out of here.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.220
There's someone that convenient here?

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.060
I don't know, but let's find out.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.600
The others should be
somewhere in this world, too.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.580
Kotori! Hey, Kotori!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.250
Concern. She won't wake up.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:21.300
In that case... Oh, Shido! Over here!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:27.890
Request. Kotori's in danger.
She needs a cardiac massage.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:34.060
Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.390
U-Uh... Huh?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.360
We fooled you, Kotori!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:46.110
Agreement. I figured Shido's name
might wake you by the power of love.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.990
"Ratatoskr"

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:52.950
What this?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.620
I guess I'm the Little Match Girl.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.750
This must be Westcott's doing.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:08.260
This is a vision? It's so real!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.640
Wonder! Even Shido is in it!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:17.890
Kotori's feelings for Shido must've
made their way into her dreams.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:23.400
I-It's supposed to be her dead grandma!
Anyway, what's your story?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:25.990
What's this?

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:29.950
Before we knew it,
we found ourselves in a forest.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.620
After walking a bit,
we came upon a candy house.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:41.830
Explanation. Since we were hungry,
we snacked on the walls and roof.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.960
A-ha. Hansel and Gretel, huh?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:51.140
A creepy hag tried talking to us,
but we ignored her and ran away.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:55.640
Agreement. She chased us
with terrifying speed.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.940
But nobody can keep pace with us!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:05.900
Truth. Kaguya had tears in her eyes
and may have peed herself.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.860
I didn't pee myself!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:20.210
We've gotta find the others
and get back to our world.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:24.080
Though, where do we even start?

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.550
So many carriages today. What's happening?

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:33.090
I heard they're revealing something
amazing at the castle ball.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:38.390
The emperor captured
a mermaid and plans to show it off!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.890
They say it sings, "Darling! Darling!"

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.150
Scattered battles around base!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.610
DEM Wizards and Bandersnatch confirmed!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.950
--The Commander?!
--Can't reach her!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.040
God help us! Misty help us!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.830
Relax.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:06.460
In times like this, losing your cool
is more dangerous than the enemy.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:11.550
Don't worry. I know the crew's
capabilities better than anyone.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.850
Well, well. You stole my thunder.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:21.310
Like MARIA said, let's stay calm.
Have we heard from base?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.060
Woodman is safe.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:29.270
He's urging us to take Fraxinus
and head to Zodiac.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:34.700
In that case, let's protect it
until Kotori and the others return.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.950
Damage to our hull!
Enemies have breached the hangar!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:44.210
MARIA, set Territory to 50
and activate jamming.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.040
Acknowledged. Deploying Territory.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.130
Our Territory neutralized the enemy.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.300
It's deadly to machines that move
by generative magic.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.970
Well done, Vice Commander!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:05.480
But in the end, it's just Territory.
It won't stop humans and bullets.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:07.860
Hands up!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.860
Move and we'll shoot!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.360
So this is Fraxinus...

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.320
Westcott will be pleased.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.300
Huh?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.180
Thank MARIA for that projection!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.480
M-Mi...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:54.070
Misty? Misty?!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.910
How dare you hurt my Misty!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.920
Good work, everyone.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.340
Nakatsugawa, Shiizaki...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.680
Y-Yes?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.220
I've seen the usefulness
of figures and straw dolls.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.680
I'm granting permission
to bring them on the bridge.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:31.020
Misty!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:44.160
Whoa. That castle
sure shouts "fairy tale."

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:48.870
Lots of people come through here,
so we might learn something.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.790
C'mon, let us in!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.290
Shido, look!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.420
--Meanie!
--Stubborn.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.220
Kotori? Kaguya! Yuzuru!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.300
Shido! You're all right!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.510
Uh, what's with the outfits?

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.390
You're one to talk.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:09.180
What's the problem here?

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:12.810
We came to see the castle's mermaid.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:17.400
I guess it cries out, "Darling! Darling!"

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.530
I see.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.410
But this guard is a doofus!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.580
Upset. He won't let us through!

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.750
Of course not! You're not
getting past me dressed like that!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.050
Greetings, my friends.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.470
Natsumi?

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:57.900
Sir, these are my attendants.
May they enter with me?

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:01.320
Uh, but...! That's...!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.320
You don't mind, do you?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:07.870
Uh... G-Go on ahead.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.920
Um...

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:27.720
You little..! Get your witchcraft
outta here and don't come back!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.480
So Natsun's Cinderella, huh?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.190
"Natsun"?

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:38.150
Grr! At this rate,
we'll just have to use force!

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.900
Agreement. With our numbers,
we don't need Angels.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:45.450
Hold up. Let's be smart about this.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:46.950
"Ratatoskr"

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.670
Clever thinking, Kotori.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:04.430
Don't let the candle go out
or we'll go back to normal.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.260
Why am I in a dress, too?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:11.850
Makes it easier
to get into the ball, right?

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:26.030
What a fancy castle.
That's Cinderella's ball for you.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:30.410
Where's the mermaid?
I don't see it anywhere.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.700
Ladies and gentlemen, look to the stage!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.670
It's time to behold
the song of the mermaid!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.340
--Miku!
--Miku!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:51.310
Darling! Everyone! What lovely dresses!
And Darling's in Shiori mode!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:56.480
Fill me in on the details!
Did anyone think to record it?!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:01.150
C-Calm down. Anyway,
how did you end up here?

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.070
Before I knew it, I was in the water.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:09.700
But an evil witch said she'd make me
human in exchange for my voice.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.450
So <i>The Little Mermaid</i>, then.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.830
But if you're still a mermaid...

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:22.250
Yup! I'd never let anyone take my voice,
so I smacked her with my tail and fled!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:25.880
But then, fishermen
caught me on the beach...

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.340
What's this commotion?

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.810
The emperor!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.140
--Wha--?!
--Oh my!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:44.070
--Th-That's the rumored...
--What a wonderful outfit!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:47.530
Truly! It's like a veil of mist!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.740
Shido, everyone... I'm glad you're okay.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:59.620
Y-Yeah. But... are you okay?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.540
I don't understand.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.710
How to put it...?
You didn't get mugged, did you?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.880
Origami! What kind of
outfit is that?! You're naked!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.930
Did you just...?!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:16.060
Did she insult the emperor's clothes?!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.020
I got it from wandering tailors.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:22.350
Those without love for Shido can't see it.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.940
And since you can't see it, Tohka...

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.900
Wha--?! H-Hold on!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:31.490
M-My, what splendid skin-like clothes!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:36.370
No need to fake it, Tohka.
It's <i>The Emperor's New Clothes</i>.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.910
<i>The Emperor's New Clothes</i>...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.210
I had no idea.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.840
You didn't think it strange?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:52.180
When they said you can't see it without
love, I thought I caught of glimpse of it.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.890
I-I see...

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:57.770
But this is good.
We're all together again.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.430
Yeah. And Origami is emperor.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:05.690
She can use her power to search
the lands for a superhero.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.480
"Superhero"?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:15.490
Yup. There might be someone powerful
who can return us to our world.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:20.620
True. With my power,
I can issue a search of the lands.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.580
We might find an item or something.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:27.670
Ooh! We'll get back
to our world in no time!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.550
Let's start right away and--!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.260
The wolf!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.070
It can't be! Ogres from Onigashima!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.860
You weren't coming,
so we came to find you!

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.370
What the hell?!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:01.830
Oh, that's mine. A monster from
<i>Silver Bullet</i> revives in Part 2,

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.080
gets powerful in Part 3, and
comes for revenge on Fatima.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.420
Those damn recurring villains!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.050
So be it!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:19.010
Wait! We can't use our Spirit
power here! We won't win!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.140
Then what should we do?!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:30.150
Would not the Spirits you "save"
be exposed to greater peril?

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:34.530
Shido, I tire hearing of this hypocrisy.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.780
Run, you guys!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:47.960
"Little Red Riding Hood"

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.550
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.010
Just a neighborhood high schooler.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.850
--That's... Shido?
--What's going on?

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:08.690
Oh! He's from the manga we drew!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:13.360
Oh, yeah! 'Cuz this world
is a mix of stories!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:17.990
It's not unusual for the "Shido"
from our manga to be here.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:23.240
What's more, he's like
Shido Itsuka, but not!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:28.960
He's a manga hero!
He's both super cool and super strong!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.790
You okay, me?

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.630
Y-Yeah. Thanks, me.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:38.510
Now we're starting to sound like Kurumi.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:44.520
This can't be good. If you're all here,
I take it Westcott's involved?

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:49.600
That saves the explanation.
Can we return to our world somehow?

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.770
We need to get back as soon as possible.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:55.650
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:00.200
This world was made by a Demon King,

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:04.280
which means it can be broken by an Angel.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:10.460
Though I may be fiction, while in
this world, my Angel's the real deal!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.220
Go through here to get back!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.220
Thanks, Shido!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.650
Hey, me.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.320
Hmm? What's up, me?

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:43.200
I'm supposed to help
this Spirit named Mukuro, but...

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.120
You have doubts:

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:49.750
"If I hadn't sealed the Spirits' powers,

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:53.540
they wouldn't face so much danger.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:57.710
Maybe I made the wrong choice."

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.920
I know, because you're me.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:05.720
Even so, I'd go help that Spirit.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:08.890
But Mukuro wants to be left alone.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:13.650
True, but doesn't it seem strange to you?

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:17.400
She locked her heart to not be sad.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:22.400
Doesn't that mean she was sad enough
at one point to resort to that?

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:28.830
Her words sound like an SOS to me.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:32.290
For starters, what is it I want for her?

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:35.130
"What is it I want for her?"

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.880
I see. You're right. Thanks.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.890
Good luck, high schooler.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:48.010
You, too, neighborhood high schooler.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.310
Took long enough, Shido.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:21:00.570
What happened?
Did you talk with the other Shido?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:09.990
Yeah, just a bit. But I'm fine now.
Let's go save Mukuro!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.870
Commander!

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:22.300
We need to get to Mukuro quickly.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.840
Prepare to launch!
Realizers in parallel drive!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:31.680
Deploy Territory in avoid mode!
Fraxinus Excelsior, lift off!

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.000
"Episode 05:
'Fairy Tale'"

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:32.220
Fraxinus gets a new life,
but blocking their way is Ellen in Goetia.

00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:34.970
How will this fated showdown end?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.430
Next time: "An Opened Heart."

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:39.980
"Episode 06: 'An Opened Heart"'

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:39.940
Shido and Mukuro's destiny awaits!
